WEBVTT

01:40.420 --> 01:45.810
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.300 --> 01:50.880
[Episode 5]

01:54.840 --> 01:56.150
[Wangquan]

01:57.759 --> 02:00.340
As expected, a problem has arisen.

02:00.560 --> 02:02.560
Ten years ago, Master disappeared.

02:02.640 --> 02:04.680
He took the Wangquan Sword with him.

02:05.280 --> 02:08.840
No matter how meticulously we forge
in the Wangquan Sword Furnace,

02:08.840 --> 02:10.080
a fake sword

02:10.130 --> 02:12.290
is still just a fake sword.

02:11.300 --> 02:11.950
[Wangquan]

02:13.430 --> 02:14.830
At Nangong's residence,

02:15.280 --> 02:17.220
Zhang Zheng noticed something was amiss,

02:17.220 --> 02:18.550
but he didn't expose me.

02:19.430 --> 02:21.090
We'll deal with it as it comes.

02:21.460 --> 02:22.800
Don't worry, Young Master.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.190
I'll forge a new sword as soon as possible.

02:26.560 --> 02:27.620
The family masters

02:27.750 --> 02:29.550
are already waiting in the hall.

02:29.630 --> 02:31.280
Except for the Nangong family,

02:31.280 --> 02:33.079
all the families have gathered.

02:39.680 --> 02:41.430
Young Master Wangquan.

02:44.010 --> 02:45.910
[Yang Huanzhou, Master of the Clairvoyant Yang family, Yiqi Alliance]

02:48.690 --> 02:49.490
Mr. Fei.

02:52.030 --> 02:53.490
The Yiqi Alliance decree:

02:53.600 --> 02:56.970
Forging swords with demon cores
will backfire on the sword masters,

02:56.970 --> 02:59.120
causing them to lose their mind.

02:59.190 --> 03:00.760
The harm is terrifying.

03:01.070 --> 03:02.280
From today onwards,

03:02.750 --> 03:04.210
within the Yiqi Alliance,

03:04.360 --> 03:08.110
all families are forbidden to
forge swords using demon cores.

03:16.280 --> 03:17.720
Wangquan Hongye.

03:18.710 --> 03:21.870
Don't think that just because you've banned
the use of demon cores in sword forging,

03:21.870 --> 03:24.680
the Nangong family has no other way
to deal with you.

03:24.680 --> 03:27.840
We still have a long fight ahead of us.

03:39.690 --> 03:42.690
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

03:43.560 --> 03:44.400
Grandfather.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.150
Mu Xiaowu has been kneeling outside our house

03:46.150 --> 03:47.329
for a day and a night now.

03:47.329 --> 03:49.060
If he keeps kneeling like this,

03:49.400 --> 03:51.000
I'm afraid something bad might happen.

03:51.000 --> 03:51.780
Yitan.

03:53.030 --> 03:55.130
You don't need to get involved in this matter.

03:55.130 --> 03:57.470
[Yang Ying from the Clairvoyant Yang family, Yiqi Alliance]

03:55.930 --> 03:58.590
Even if our Yang family
has fallen on hard times,

03:58.710 --> 04:00.310
we are still descendants of a noble family.

04:00.310 --> 04:02.150
It's that aunt of yours

04:02.240 --> 04:04.870
who shamelessly did such a foolish thing

04:05.690 --> 04:07.950
and insisted that I agree to their marriage.

04:07.950 --> 04:09.440
Let her dream on.

04:10.280 --> 04:11.080
Grandfather.

04:12.430 --> 04:14.840
Do you really think Aunt cares about

04:15.320 --> 04:17.610
being a descendant of a noble family?

04:20.120 --> 04:20.800
Yitan!

04:21.160 --> 04:22.450
What kind of talk is that?

04:22.450 --> 04:23.510
What your aunt has ruined

04:23.510 --> 04:25.070
is the reputation of our Yang family.

04:25.070 --> 04:27.280
It's you, Yitan, who will be
affected by this.

04:27.280 --> 04:28.090
Yang Ying.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.150
Get a midwife here

04:30.560 --> 04:32.890
and get rid of that bastard in Yan's belly.

04:32.920 --> 04:33.680
Yes.

04:33.980 --> 04:34.980
Stop right there.

04:38.380 --> 04:39.550
I'd like to see

04:39.610 --> 04:41.940
who dares to lay a finger on my aunt.

04:42.190 --> 04:42.800
You...

04:44.030 --> 04:45.560
If you want to agree to this marriage,

04:45.560 --> 04:47.020
it'll be over my dead body!

04:49.330 --> 04:50.600
Father, don't be angry.

04:50.600 --> 04:52.230
Yitan, watch your words!

04:52.320 --> 04:55.050
Your grandfather is too old to handle such anger.

04:56.920 --> 04:57.630
Fine.

04:59.909 --> 05:02.310
Then I'll go kneel with Mu Xiaowu right now,

05:02.630 --> 05:05.290
until you agree to this marriage, Grandfather.

05:08.060 --> 05:08.920
Please calm down, Father.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.920
Don't be angry.

05:30.270 --> 05:31.600
Why are you doing this?

05:33.630 --> 05:35.830
Uncle, I'll kneel with you.

05:44.450 --> 05:48.640
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

05:46.310 --> 05:47.070
Father.

05:47.240 --> 05:49.680
It seems Yitan is serious about this.

05:55.640 --> 05:56.690
Let them kneel.

06:00.330 --> 06:01.130
Father,

06:01.350 --> 06:02.230
let it go.

06:03.070 --> 06:05.390
As the saying goes, "Not for the monk's sake
but for the Buddha's sake."

06:05.390 --> 06:07.190
In the three generations of our Yang family,

06:07.190 --> 06:08.190
apart from Yitan

06:08.190 --> 06:09.650
and his deceased father,

06:10.390 --> 06:12.280
how many others are clairvoyant?

06:13.310 --> 06:15.190
Don't push Yitan

06:15.680 --> 06:16.940
too far.

06:27.430 --> 06:29.340
Yitan's marriage is the most decent cover

06:29.340 --> 06:32.490
for our Yang family's shame.

06:32.800 --> 06:34.850
We can't afford any mishaps.

06:37.510 --> 06:40.170
Master, Young Master Wangquan
is here to visit.

06:41.450 --> 06:42.280
Who?

06:46.400 --> 06:50.200
Young Master Wangquan, what important matter

06:50.220 --> 06:51.950
brings you to our humble abode?

06:52.120 --> 06:54.159
Master, you may have already heard that

06:54.159 --> 06:58.159
it was because I personally granted
a special pardon to your son-in-law

06:58.200 --> 07:00.430
that the Inspection Bureau released him.

07:00.430 --> 07:01.630
I have heard about it.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.040
Young Master.

07:05.070 --> 07:06.330
It truly is a noble act.

07:06.510 --> 07:08.240
I'm not the noble one.

07:08.600 --> 07:11.070
It was just

07:11.570 --> 07:13.170
Xiaowu once saved my life by chance.

07:13.170 --> 07:16.430
I'm merely repaying the kindness.

07:18.920 --> 07:21.680
He has never mentioned this matter before.

07:22.210 --> 07:24.600
So the truly noble one is

07:24.870 --> 07:26.470
your great son-in-law here.

07:34.400 --> 07:37.140
Xiaowu's family all perished in the flood.

07:37.280 --> 07:39.610
So I, as the young master, took the liberty,

07:39.610 --> 07:41.180
to prepare these betrothal gifts.

07:41.180 --> 07:43.640
I also asked a highly respected Taoist priest

07:43.640 --> 07:46.070
to pick an auspicious date,

07:53.760 --> 07:57.140
[Mu Renzhi, Yang Yan]
[July 18th]

07:55.720 --> 07:56.750
July 18th.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.880
It will bring prosperity to the ancestors,

07:58.880 --> 08:00.680
and good fortune in all matters.

08:00.730 --> 08:02.510
July 18th?

08:02.620 --> 08:04.560
Isn't that just a month from now?

08:04.580 --> 08:07.460
To be precise, it's a little over a month.

08:07.830 --> 08:09.040
This period is neither too long

08:09.040 --> 08:10.000
nor too short.

08:10.290 --> 08:11.690
It's just there won't be another

08:11.690 --> 08:15.140
auspicious date like this after that day.

08:17.000 --> 08:19.210
What do you think, Master?

08:20.400 --> 08:22.850
The date is well chosen,

08:22.880 --> 08:23.510
but...

08:23.510 --> 08:24.360
Excellent.

08:24.380 --> 08:26.020
Since you have no objections, Master,

08:26.020 --> 08:26.900
Xiaowu,

08:27.240 --> 08:29.100
serve tea to your father-in-law.

08:38.390 --> 08:39.200
Master.

08:40.510 --> 08:43.080
If you agree to let Yan marry me,

08:43.510 --> 08:44.570
I, Xiaowu, promise

08:45.120 --> 08:47.850
that I will dedicate the rest of my life

08:48.120 --> 08:50.760
to ensuring Yan's happiness and security.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.910
If you want to marry my Yan,

08:58.690 --> 09:00.510
you must marry into our family

09:00.730 --> 09:02.890
and live with our Yang family.

09:15.020 --> 09:16.220
I, Xiaowu, will obey.

09:23.750 --> 09:26.900
Since the auspicious date was set by you,

09:28.630 --> 09:31.200
Young Master, I have a request as well.

09:31.600 --> 09:32.660
On the wedding day,

09:33.290 --> 09:34.820
I will definitely be there.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.270
Good.

09:49.070 --> 09:50.030
Xiaowu.

09:50.050 --> 09:51.180
-Yan.
-How did it go?

09:53.340 --> 09:55.980
We did it. Our marriage is settled.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.550
My father agreed?

10:00.360 --> 10:03.150
The wedding date is set for one month from now.

10:05.090 --> 10:05.930
That's great.

10:08.910 --> 10:10.840
Aunt, he knelt for too long.

10:10.860 --> 10:11.720
Go and rest now.

10:14.560 --> 10:16.050
I, Xiaowu, will surely repay

10:16.050 --> 10:18.970
your kindness in the future, Young Master.

10:32.280 --> 10:33.050
Hongye.

10:33.550 --> 10:34.750
Why did you come here?

10:35.520 --> 10:38.180
You just found out about your aunt and Mu Xiaowu?

10:40.440 --> 10:43.250
You know about my family's situation, Hongye.

10:44.700 --> 10:46.650
I've looked into Mu Xiaowu's background.

10:46.650 --> 10:47.910
He is indeed talented.

10:47.950 --> 10:49.270
After he joins the Yang family,

10:49.270 --> 10:50.700
he should become a great help to you

10:50.700 --> 10:53.560
in improving the Yang family's current situation.

10:54.360 --> 10:55.550
Hongye, I-

10:55.550 --> 10:56.150
Alright.

10:57.270 --> 10:58.270
I'll be going now.

11:22.990 --> 11:25.320
Now that Yang Yan's matter is resolved,

11:25.320 --> 11:27.050
your face is glowing, Huaizhu.

11:27.670 --> 11:30.080
Only when she and Xiaowu successfully get married

11:30.080 --> 11:33.010
can this matter be considered completely resolved.

11:33.250 --> 11:36.450
Then where does this glow on your face
come from, Huaizhu?

11:38.870 --> 11:41.510
Could it be that since July 7th is approaching,

11:41.510 --> 11:43.240
it's the glow of anticipation?

11:43.750 --> 11:44.550
You remember

11:44.550 --> 11:45.910
the date quite clearly.

11:45.910 --> 11:46.790
Of course.

11:46.790 --> 11:48.270
That's my masked brother-in-law, after all.

11:48.270 --> 11:49.080
I'm

11:49.080 --> 11:50.020
very satisfied with him.

11:50.020 --> 11:52.150
It can be said that it was love at first-

11:52.330 --> 11:55.390
No, it was love at first sight
on behalf of you, Huaizhu.

12:00.070 --> 12:01.390
Miss Huaizhu. Miss Qinlan.

12:01.390 --> 12:02.770
Senior Renfeng has returned.

12:02.770 --> 12:05.110
Master asked you to welcome him
in the front hall.

12:05.110 --> 12:05.820
Got it.

12:08.480 --> 12:11.360
Master, during my trip down the mountain
to hunt demons this time,

12:10.040 --> 12:12.250
[Jin Renfeng, the eldest disciple of Divine Fire Villa]

12:11.450 --> 12:13.180
the people were very grateful.

12:13.410 --> 12:15.930
They specially prepared these treasures for you

12:15.930 --> 12:17.720
and insisted that you must accept them.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.710
Renfeng.

12:21.120 --> 12:24.500
These things are a token of their sincerity.

12:24.630 --> 12:26.030
You may accept them.

12:26.490 --> 12:27.820
However, in the future,

12:29.120 --> 12:31.120
we shouldn't accept any more gifts.

12:31.270 --> 12:31.870
Father.

12:32.270 --> 12:32.840
Yes.

12:34.230 --> 12:35.680
Senior Renfeng, you're here.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.070
When did you arrive?

12:37.090 --> 12:38.780
I just returned to the villa.

12:38.980 --> 12:39.910
Senior Renfeng.

12:40.970 --> 12:41.640
Father.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.430
Oh, right, Junior Huaizhu.

12:46.430 --> 12:49.740
During my trip down the mountain this time,
I thought of you often,

12:49.740 --> 12:51.290
so I specially prepared a gift for you.

12:51.290 --> 12:53.270
Do you like this hairpin?

12:57.580 --> 12:59.110
I appreciate your gesture.

12:59.110 --> 13:01.640
Thank you for your kindness, Senior Renfeng.

13:03.940 --> 13:05.200
The medicine is ready.

13:05.420 --> 13:06.820
I'll serve you to take it.

13:12.440 --> 13:13.980
It seems that after so many years,

13:13.980 --> 13:16.310
someone still doesn't know Huaizhu well.

13:16.480 --> 13:19.340
She doesn't like these gaudy, glittering objects.

13:21.290 --> 13:24.150
Give it to me. I'll go exchange it
for some nice food.

13:25.280 --> 13:28.100
Renfeng, you've just returned.

13:28.130 --> 13:30.330
Go back to your room and have a good rest.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.440
Yes, Master.

13:40.150 --> 13:42.510
Even if you don't want to accept his pursuit,

13:42.510 --> 13:43.870
don't be so harsh.

13:44.510 --> 13:47.280
After all, he is your eldest senior.

13:47.300 --> 13:48.620
I understand that you value him highly

13:48.620 --> 13:50.550
because he's the posthumous son

13:50.570 --> 13:52.170
of an old friend of yours, Father.

13:52.170 --> 13:53.370
That's exactly why

13:53.670 --> 13:56.030
I need to be very clear about my attitude.

13:58.750 --> 14:00.000
Yes. Right.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.270
You have a point, Huaizhu.

14:02.830 --> 14:06.070
I won't interfere with whom my Huaizhu likes.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.490
Take your medicine.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.280
Huaizhu.

14:26.950 --> 14:28.950
I have all the patience in the world.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.670
One day,

14:30.910 --> 14:32.550
you will be mine.

14:35.290 --> 14:38.870
[Wangquan Manor]

14:37.550 --> 14:39.080
Although Nangong Ye is dead, the Inspection Bureau,

14:39.080 --> 14:41.720
which has always been independent from the Yiqi Alliance,

14:41.720 --> 14:43.670
is still in the hands of the Nangong family.

14:43.670 --> 14:46.150
The Nangong family's interests are deeply intertwined with
those of other noble families,

14:46.150 --> 14:47.750
making it difficult to shake their position for now.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.410
Young Master, you still need to take control of

14:49.410 --> 14:53.360
the Inspection Bureau, which can keep the noble families in check.

14:55.790 --> 14:57.550
On such a beautiful day,

14:57.670 --> 14:58.270
Hongye,

14:58.360 --> 14:59.320
you and Mr. Fei shouldn't keep talking about

14:59.320 --> 15:01.320
such unpleasant matters.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.680
I have something important to discuss with you.

15:02.680 --> 15:03.600
What is it?

15:04.630 --> 15:05.320
Look.

15:06.530 --> 15:09.060
Choose one of these two outfits that you like.

15:14.490 --> 15:15.370
The left one.

15:16.420 --> 15:17.840
Alright, the left one.

15:17.840 --> 15:18.570
Eliminated.

15:18.750 --> 15:19.390
Alright.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.520
You may leave now.

15:21.680 --> 15:23.610
I'll go attend to my duties as well.

15:27.860 --> 15:30.340
Indeed, this outfit suits you better.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.510
Is my taste really that...

15:31.510 --> 15:32.390
Hopeless.

15:32.490 --> 15:35.000
But you have a good eye for people.

15:35.460 --> 15:38.530
Why don't you wear this outfit to the Bamboo Pavilion
by River Huai tomorrow?

15:38.530 --> 15:39.030
You...

15:40.400 --> 15:42.320
I noticed this morning that you glanced

15:42.320 --> 15:44.050
at the scabbard several times.

15:44.390 --> 15:45.870
A beautiful day, a lovely scene,
and a charming person.

15:45.870 --> 15:47.030
The timing is perfect.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.650
So, take off your mask

15:48.670 --> 15:50.960
and tell her who you are.

16:06.310 --> 16:09.430
[July 7th]

16:31.660 --> 16:34.040
[Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

16:51.640 --> 16:53.490
♪ The night breeze is gentle ♪

16:54.760 --> 16:57.200
♪ Rushing the sunset into dream ♪

16:58.350 --> 17:00.870
♪ The fireflies fly in the night sky ♪

16:58.400 --> 17:01.920
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

17:03.310 --> 17:05.349
♪ The wine warms my throat ♪

17:06.140 --> 17:09.000
♪ The lake is wrinkled ♪

17:10.369 --> 17:12.980
♪ Waiting for you to dock by the riverside ♪

17:15.470 --> 17:18.349
♪ With appropriate makeup ♪

17:20.660 --> 17:23.480
♪ Even gentler than the moon ♪

17:25.619 --> 17:26.940
♪ Though I haven't gotten close to you ♪

17:27.579 --> 17:29.330
♪ My heart is already fluttering ♪

17:30.400 --> 17:35.080
♪ Just like a dream of midsummer ♪

17:35.470 --> 17:38.260
River Huai is as clear as a mirror,
reflecting the rocks and mountains.

17:38.260 --> 17:40.280
♪ In the forest ♪

17:38.400 --> 17:41.000
The shadow takes us back to the bamboo forest.

17:40.870 --> 17:42.870
♪ Wine drops fall ♪

17:42.030 --> 17:44.510
This place is truly a wonderful spot.

17:43.660 --> 17:45.730
♪ At the tip of my heart ♪

17:45.960 --> 17:48.550
Fancy carp brings ripples in July.

17:46.390 --> 17:48.320
♪ Face blushing ♪

17:49.150 --> 17:50.960
♪ Hands fiddling ♪

17:49.380 --> 17:52.040
The wind carries graceful and delicate fragrance.

17:52.040 --> 17:53.660
♪ Clothes soaked wet ♪

17:52.330 --> 17:54.650
This is also a good season.

17:54.300 --> 17:56.370
♪ The wine diminishing ♪

17:55.510 --> 17:56.640
You're right, Miss.

17:57.060 --> 17:58.500
♪ Love is getting deeper ♪

17:59.690 --> 18:01.910
♪ The full moon rises ♪

18:02.550 --> 18:04.340
♪ Our shadows overlap ♪

18:04.110 --> 18:04.960
What's wrong?

18:05.090 --> 18:07.170
♪ Worried that this scene ♪

18:05.960 --> 18:07.950
I see you gently holding the bamboo flute, Miss.

18:07.950 --> 18:09.490
♪ Will pass too quickly ♪

18:08.240 --> 18:10.200
With these mountains and this scenery,

18:10.200 --> 18:12.510
I can't help but feel the echoes
in the valley of my heart.

18:10.670 --> 18:12.370
♪ If I'm granted a wish ♪

18:12.960 --> 18:15.790
I wonder if you could play us a tune, Miss.

18:13.130 --> 18:15.120
♪ I don't wish for anything else ♪

18:16.160 --> 18:17.830
♪ I only hope that God ♪

18:16.590 --> 18:18.520
Actually, I don't know how to play.

18:18.860 --> 18:20.300
♪ Will bless ♪

18:20.200 --> 18:21.870
I always hold this flute only because

18:21.870 --> 18:24.240
♪ This love ♪

18:22.070 --> 18:24.070
when I was learning magic back then,

18:24.650 --> 18:26.110
among all the magical artifacts
my father gave me,

18:25.630 --> 18:28.990
♪ To last longer ♪

18:26.240 --> 18:27.440
it was the prettiest.

18:28.350 --> 18:29.310
Besides,

18:29.410 --> 18:30.750
I can't recite poetry,

18:30.770 --> 18:31.960
can't sing,

18:32.030 --> 18:33.240
don't know how to play musical instruments or chess,
can't do calligraphy or painting,

18:33.240 --> 18:35.680
nor can I cook, do laundry, or make beds.

18:37.240 --> 18:40.240
The only thing I'm good at is
fighting and magic duels.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.640
So, what do you think?

18:41.680 --> 18:42.940
Are you disappointed?

18:44.950 --> 18:46.920
The ancients said the beauty of a fair lady

18:46.920 --> 18:47.960
is in her grace,

18:47.960 --> 18:48.750
with her music and dance as her posture,

18:48.750 --> 18:51.360
and her calligraphy and painting
as her character.

18:51.360 --> 18:52.400
Come on.

18:52.440 --> 18:55.160
Since mortals use these words
to evaluate worldly charms,

18:55.160 --> 18:57.070
let's not apply any powder or rouge,

18:57.070 --> 18:59.910
and be naturally beautiful and happy
among the clouds.

18:59.910 --> 19:01.640
♪ The full moon rises ♪

19:02.630 --> 19:04.570
♪ Our shadows overlap ♪

19:05.030 --> 19:07.280
♪ Worried that this scene ♪

19:07.800 --> 19:09.230
♪ Will pass too quickly ♪

19:10.480 --> 19:12.530
♪ If I'm granted a wish ♪

19:13.230 --> 19:15.030
♪ I don't wish for anything else ♪

19:15.890 --> 19:17.760
♪ I only hope that God ♪

19:18.650 --> 19:20.120
♪ Will bless ♪

19:21.180 --> 19:23.070
♪ Falling in love for the first time ♪

19:23.890 --> 19:25.670
♪ I miss you all the time ♪

19:26.720 --> 19:28.340
♪ But I can't say anything ♪

19:29.310 --> 19:31.140
♪ To express it ♪

19:31.820 --> 19:33.210
♪ Frog and insect chirps ♪

19:34.250 --> 19:36.240
♪ Rapid and non-stopping ♪

19:37.630 --> 19:39.220
♪ The leaves rustle ♪

19:39.960 --> 19:42.390
♪ Like smashing bamboo ♪

19:43.960 --> 19:45.710
♪ In the whole universe ♪

19:47.140 --> 19:52.070
♪ All beings celebrate ♪

20:25.680 --> 20:26.110
This...

20:26.110 --> 20:26.570
Like...

20:28.380 --> 20:29.310
You go first.

20:30.030 --> 20:30.790
You go first.

20:32.110 --> 20:33.240
I wanted to say

20:34.270 --> 20:37.510
it's nice to share such beautiful scenery

20:38.110 --> 20:38.960
with someone.

20:39.750 --> 20:40.790
This is also

20:41.960 --> 20:43.090
what I wanted to say.

20:50.200 --> 20:52.830
There's something I've been curious about.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.790
What is it?

20:55.160 --> 20:56.550
Why, even until now,

20:56.920 --> 20:59.850
have you never asked about
who I am beneath this mask?

21:00.240 --> 21:02.240
You use a mask to hide yourself.

21:03.030 --> 21:05.350
I believe you have your reasons.

21:06.750 --> 21:07.790
To me,

21:08.300 --> 21:11.200
your true self is more important
than your name.

21:12.510 --> 21:13.550
Besides,

21:14.070 --> 21:16.230
when you want to tell me someday,

21:17.000 --> 21:18.110
you will do so.

21:20.270 --> 21:21.000
Alright.

21:27.680 --> 21:29.960
The sunset is fading so quickly today.

21:31.110 --> 21:32.910
I wish it could last a bit longer.

21:33.510 --> 21:35.400
If you feel the sunset is too short,

21:35.400 --> 21:36.350
next time,

21:37.510 --> 21:39.310
let's watch the stars together.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.440
Okay.

21:53.910 --> 22:01.980
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

22:19.640 --> 22:20.720
Guess what?

22:21.310 --> 22:23.880
He seemed like he was under the influence of
some kind of drug.

22:23.880 --> 22:26.100
He just ran off with her.

22:26.540 --> 22:27.240
Really?

22:27.240 --> 22:27.880
Is that true?

22:27.880 --> 22:28.510
Actually, it's like this...

22:28.510 --> 22:32.560
You guys are enjoying my anecdote
like this watermelon here, aren't you?

22:32.560 --> 22:34.420
You bet we are.

22:34.640 --> 22:37.400
On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai.

22:38.030 --> 22:39.890
It sounds absolutely wonderful.

22:41.090 --> 22:43.110
How come you get watermelon seeds everywhere?

22:43.110 --> 22:45.070
Come on, have a seat.

22:45.070 --> 22:45.830
Sit.

22:48.310 --> 22:49.310
Move aside.

22:51.270 --> 22:52.110
So, how was it?

22:52.240 --> 22:54.490
You've been out for a whole day.

22:54.550 --> 22:56.510
Did you have a pleasant time with Miss Huaizhu?

22:56.510 --> 22:58.510
Did you take off your mask already?

22:58.510 --> 23:00.000
Was Miss Huaizhu surprised or pleased?

23:00.000 --> 23:03.130
Why don't you two go set up a stall
and perform some opera?

23:03.780 --> 23:04.990
That's not important.

23:04.990 --> 23:07.990
What's important is when you two
are getting married.

23:13.810 --> 23:16.010
Is your throat feeling uncomfortable?

23:19.190 --> 23:20.160
Hongye.

23:20.160 --> 23:21.400
Actually, we're here today

23:21.400 --> 23:23.350
to report to you about Nangong Ye.

23:23.370 --> 23:25.310
Zizai, why are you changing the subject?

23:25.310 --> 23:26.270
We aren't done with this topic yet.

23:26.270 --> 23:27.240
That's right.

23:27.260 --> 23:28.770
When we were gossiping earlier,

23:28.770 --> 23:29.960
didn't you tell the story of

23:29.960 --> 23:32.200
the Dongfang Divine Fire
fighting the Poison King?

23:32.200 --> 23:34.310
You were so excited that your eyebrows
almost flew off your face.

23:34.310 --> 23:35.110
Was I?

23:35.240 --> 23:36.220
Yes, you were.

23:36.350 --> 23:37.190
Go on.

23:43.890 --> 23:45.280
Today,

23:45.630 --> 23:49.090
I did go to the Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai
with Miss Huaizhu.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.120
We got along

23:51.880 --> 23:53.200
very well indeed.

23:55.440 --> 23:57.040
But I didn't take off my mask.

23:57.540 --> 23:59.680
Because the timing and atmosphere
weren't right.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.340
Satisfied?

24:01.220 --> 24:02.240
Boring.

24:02.720 --> 24:05.090
Are you worried that Huaizhu

24:05.160 --> 24:07.420
won't like the real you beneath the mask?

24:07.740 --> 24:09.400
Hongye, don't be discouraged.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.550
As the saying goes,

24:10.590 --> 24:11.830
"A good woman can't resist a persistent man."

24:11.830 --> 24:13.890
"A vicious dog fears a sturdy stick."

24:16.610 --> 24:19.850
If you don't know how to finish my sentence,
don't force it, okay?

24:19.850 --> 24:22.450
Well, let's get back to the important matters.

24:39.820 --> 24:44.290
As they say, "The spirit like an orchid,
forever unchanging.

24:44.740 --> 24:46.930
The heart like an orchid..."

24:47.790 --> 24:48.790
What was it again?

24:49.920 --> 24:51.180
Never mind, forget it.

24:54.790 --> 24:57.210
Huaizhu, you went to the Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai.

24:57.210 --> 25:01.420
You're quite satisfied with my
masked brother-in-law, right?

25:01.440 --> 25:02.750
What does he look like?

25:07.020 --> 25:08.500
Is he very ugly?

25:09.880 --> 25:10.890
I didn't see him.

25:11.000 --> 25:12.070
You didn't see him?

25:13.130 --> 25:15.990
Huaizhu, do you really not care about appearances?

25:16.230 --> 25:18.090
Appearance stems from the heart.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.830
I don't think he can be ugly.

25:21.510 --> 25:23.000
However, his mask...

25:25.070 --> 25:26.240
Is indeed very ugly.

25:31.400 --> 25:34.340
The Inspection Bureau should be
thoroughly investigated indeed.

25:34.340 --> 25:35.740
In recent years, behind the scenes,

25:35.740 --> 25:37.450
they have been using demon-controlling talismans.

25:37.450 --> 25:39.090
If these talismans fall into the hands of the Yiqi Alliance,

25:39.090 --> 25:40.520
we all know

25:40.550 --> 25:42.050
what the consequences will be.

25:42.050 --> 25:45.240
It's like the Nangong family using demon cores
to forge swords.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.660
It corrupts the mind

25:46.790 --> 25:48.400
and accelerates the killing
between humans and demons.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.230
To thoroughly investigate the Inspection Bureau,

25:50.230 --> 25:51.780
we need to first clarify their channels

25:51.780 --> 25:53.750
for trading demon-controlling talismans.

25:53.750 --> 25:54.460
Also,

25:54.880 --> 25:56.200
we need to keep investigating

25:56.200 --> 25:57.750
how the Nangong family learned

25:57.750 --> 25:58.750
to use demon cores in sword forging.

25:58.750 --> 25:59.750
Don't worry, Hongye.

25:59.750 --> 26:01.590
Quzhuo and I will handle this.

26:01.880 --> 26:03.240
As for you two, one is the Young Master Wangquan,

26:03.240 --> 26:04.550
and the other has a family wedding to attend.

26:04.550 --> 26:06.410
Your identities are too exposed.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.740
No, no, no.

26:09.830 --> 26:11.880
This won't do.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.350
If Hongye keeps pursuing her like this,

26:14.350 --> 26:16.350
he'll still be wearing the mask
even when he's 70.

26:16.350 --> 26:18.030
They're clearly a match made in heaven.

26:18.030 --> 26:19.160
I won't accept this.

26:20.240 --> 26:21.640
There's still a chance, right?

26:21.640 --> 26:23.360
Miss Dongfang will surely attend

26:23.360 --> 26:24.680
my aunt's wedding.

26:28.620 --> 26:30.230
That makes sense.

26:31.110 --> 26:33.550
It's time for us to lend a helping hand.

26:43.610 --> 26:45.150
Be careful, everyone.

26:48.850 --> 26:50.190
Slowly.

26:53.720 --> 26:54.790
Be careful.

26:55.500 --> 26:58.380
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

27:00.800 --> 27:03.210
You two little ones, don't run so fast.

27:03.920 --> 27:04.820
Slow down, slow down.

27:04.820 --> 27:05.550
Huaizhu.

27:06.020 --> 27:06.790
Huaizhu.

27:07.810 --> 27:10.020
The fruits and wedding cakes are all prepared.

27:10.020 --> 27:11.330
Everything has arrived.

27:11.330 --> 27:13.130
We're just missing some of Yan's

27:13.130 --> 27:14.510
headdresses and jewelry.

27:14.510 --> 27:16.740
We'll go to Ruyi Pavilion to purchase them tomorrow.

27:16.740 --> 27:17.270
Okay.

27:18.400 --> 27:19.310
Miss Huaizhu.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.770
Young Master Wangquan.

27:24.690 --> 27:27.960
The way this Young Master Wangquan
looks at Huaizhu is strange.

27:27.960 --> 27:29.160
Miss Dongfang, you've come from afar

27:29.160 --> 27:30.980
and been helping my aunt
with wedding preparations.

27:30.980 --> 27:32.310
It must be quite tiring.

27:32.370 --> 27:33.970
Why don't you two ladies stay

27:34.070 --> 27:35.800
and join Young Master Wangquan

27:36.960 --> 27:38.000
for a simple meal?

27:38.200 --> 27:39.920
Something's fishy.

27:43.920 --> 27:44.900
Sure.

27:46.270 --> 27:47.270
I'm hungry.

27:49.310 --> 27:50.640
Thank you for your trouble.

27:50.640 --> 27:51.350
Not at all.

27:55.310 --> 27:56.400
Yitan, sit here.

27:57.030 --> 27:58.720
Miss Huaizhu, please.

27:58.920 --> 27:59.400
Hongye.

27:59.960 --> 28:00.690
Come on, sit.

28:01.750 --> 28:03.840
The feng shui here is really good.

28:04.090 --> 28:05.620
I'll sit here.

28:06.130 --> 28:08.260
You even care about feng shui at a meal?

28:08.280 --> 28:09.330
What an expert.

28:09.400 --> 28:10.960
Thank you for your flattery.

28:10.960 --> 28:13.440
After all, many people have had designs on Huaizhu.

28:13.440 --> 28:14.570
I'm used to it by now.

28:15.270 --> 28:16.830
My sister is carefree and straightforward.

28:16.830 --> 28:17.750
Please don't take any offense.

28:17.750 --> 28:18.550
It's alright.

28:19.310 --> 28:20.400
Zui, let's sit.

28:28.410 --> 28:30.000
The rest of us have met

28:30.000 --> 28:31.310
at Nangong's residence before.

28:31.310 --> 28:33.070
Only Miss Qinlan is meeting us
for the first time.

28:33.070 --> 28:35.110
Let me make the introductions.

28:35.110 --> 28:35.920
No need.

28:35.920 --> 28:37.000
About what happened at Nangong's residence,

28:37.000 --> 28:38.400
Huaizhu has already told me.

28:38.400 --> 28:39.790
So I can match

28:39.790 --> 28:41.390
all your names to your faces.

28:41.830 --> 28:44.070
But since this is our first time
meeting in person,

28:44.070 --> 28:46.270
I shouldn't skip the proper etiquette.

28:46.350 --> 28:48.350
So I'll use tea instead of wine

28:49.000 --> 28:50.400
and propose a toast to...

28:50.880 --> 28:52.080
My dear nephew Yitan.

28:55.570 --> 28:56.720
Here's the thing.

28:56.740 --> 28:57.920
Yang Yan

28:57.920 --> 28:59.250
is my sister Huaizhu's best friend,

28:59.250 --> 29:01.550
and Yang Yan and I are of the same generation.

29:01.550 --> 29:02.660
Since she's your aunt,

29:02.660 --> 29:04.350
naturally, you're my nephew.

29:08.350 --> 29:09.410
Dear nephew Yitan.

29:19.550 --> 29:20.960
Dear nephew Hongye.

29:24.920 --> 29:25.720
Let's eat.

29:26.270 --> 29:28.430
There are many dishes you like.

29:28.770 --> 29:30.610
Eat more, talk less.

29:32.000 --> 29:34.090
Well, humans are born with mouths.

29:34.420 --> 29:36.360
If we only eat and don't talk,

29:36.510 --> 29:38.710
how are we different from rice buckets?

29:42.620 --> 29:44.280
I'm not referring to you guys.

29:46.500 --> 29:48.560
Don't you agree, dear nephew Hongye?

29:50.200 --> 29:51.000
Indeed.

29:52.090 --> 29:54.030
Although you're the young master,

29:54.160 --> 29:55.920
Huaizhu is already spoken for.

29:55.920 --> 29:58.320
Don't even think about making a move on her.

30:01.350 --> 30:04.030
I wonder if you've all heard of

30:04.270 --> 30:05.640
the Mask Group?

30:09.960 --> 30:10.960
Never heard of it.

30:13.710 --> 30:14.960
As expected.

30:14.960 --> 30:17.900
A mundane creature like Young Master Wangquan

30:17.960 --> 30:20.640
surely has never heard of
such an extraordinary person

30:20.640 --> 30:22.110
as the Mask Group Leader.

30:22.310 --> 30:24.720
He's the one my sister has her heart set on.

30:27.350 --> 30:30.590
Anyway, some people are absolutely
incomparable to him.

30:32.110 --> 30:32.960
Huaizhu.

30:33.270 --> 30:34.800
You didn't peel the shrimp.

30:39.200 --> 30:42.110
How exactly are some people
incomparable to him?

30:44.200 --> 30:47.350
The Mask Group Leader is chivalrous and righteous,

30:47.400 --> 30:49.030
but some people

30:49.030 --> 30:50.240
are vindictive.

30:50.780 --> 30:52.460
Although the Mask Group Leader

30:52.460 --> 30:54.110
wears a mask

30:54.110 --> 30:55.510
and dresses simply,

30:55.750 --> 30:56.960
he

30:57.070 --> 31:00.280
exudes an air of elegance and charm.

31:00.310 --> 31:01.920
Unlike some people

31:01.960 --> 31:04.160
who are clearly trying too hard.

31:07.170 --> 31:09.420
Moreover, his swordsmanship is
better than yours,

31:09.420 --> 31:10.550
he's taller than you,

31:10.550 --> 31:11.920
and he has a slimmer waist.

31:11.920 --> 31:14.380
You have absolutely no chance with Huaizhu.

31:20.070 --> 31:21.530
Zui, why are you giggling?

31:24.740 --> 31:26.030
I think

31:26.070 --> 31:28.610
Qinlan has a point.

31:28.630 --> 31:30.830
I never thought Hongye would see this day.

31:30.830 --> 31:31.850
This deserves a nice drink.

31:31.850 --> 31:33.530
Yitan, go get some wine.

31:34.350 --> 31:35.810
It's midday. Don't drink.

31:36.000 --> 31:36.590
Yes.

31:37.350 --> 31:39.830
Authority is meant to be rebelled against.

31:39.830 --> 31:40.810
Dear nephew Yitan,

31:40.810 --> 31:42.400
stand up and go get the wine.

31:51.850 --> 31:53.060
The fish is good.

31:53.090 --> 31:54.690
Let's eat. Enjoy the dishes.

31:56.580 --> 31:58.110
Some people

31:58.130 --> 32:00.330
are so mean to their own siblings,

32:00.610 --> 32:02.210
not even letting them drink.

32:02.230 --> 32:03.070
It seems to me that apart from

32:03.070 --> 32:04.790
having the hyphenated name Wangquan,

32:04.790 --> 32:06.050
he has no other merits.

32:08.590 --> 32:10.750
Forget it. I'll stop talking. Let's eat.

32:10.750 --> 32:13.080
Come on, I'll propose a toast to everyone.

32:13.190 --> 32:14.290
Right. Come on.

32:14.340 --> 32:16.110
One glass for friendship, two for affection,

32:16.110 --> 32:17.590
and three make good friends.

32:17.590 --> 32:18.550
Cheers.

32:18.550 --> 32:19.010
Cheers.

32:28.270 --> 32:29.030
Look at you.

32:34.920 --> 32:36.160
Dear nephew Yitan.

32:36.550 --> 32:39.070
So what Qinlan meant during the meal

32:39.160 --> 32:41.270
was to declare the Mask Group Leader's allegiance

32:41.270 --> 32:43.880
and tell Hongye not to have any delusions?

32:44.000 --> 32:45.730
That's what she meant, indeed.

32:46.840 --> 32:48.900
But aren't we of the same generation?

32:49.640 --> 32:50.830
That's not important.

32:50.830 --> 32:53.550
What's important is that
once the wedding is over,

32:53.550 --> 32:55.550
it'll be hard for Hongye
to have another chance.

32:55.550 --> 32:57.030
With Miss Qinlan around,

32:57.050 --> 32:58.380
it is indeed difficult.

32:58.650 --> 33:00.660
We need to make a plan.

33:00.760 --> 33:01.670
What plan?

33:02.160 --> 33:03.240
Early tomorrow morning,

33:03.240 --> 33:06.790
Miss Dongfang will go to Ruyi Pavilion
to purchase jewelry.

33:06.810 --> 33:07.810
And then?

33:07.840 --> 33:10.490
Then we'll arrange for Hongye and Miss Dongfang

33:10.490 --> 33:12.350
to have a destined encounter.

33:12.380 --> 33:13.310
Attention here.

33:13.350 --> 33:17.480
We must elevate Hongye's image of
being free-spirited and unrestrained.

33:17.750 --> 33:18.750
I'll do as you say.

33:26.880 --> 33:27.790
What's wrong?

33:27.960 --> 33:28.960
It's nothing, really.

33:28.960 --> 33:29.960
It's just I heard that you particularly like

33:29.960 --> 33:31.960
candied hawthorn, Qinlan,

33:31.960 --> 33:34.160
so I specially bought you a stick.

33:38.520 --> 33:41.000
I didn't expect that you Wangquan family

33:41.000 --> 33:42.510
would be so considerate.

33:43.000 --> 33:43.830
Thanks.

33:53.110 --> 33:54.590
This candied hawthorn stick should be enough

33:54.590 --> 33:56.450
to make her sleep for a whole noon.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.420
How's it going on your end?

33:58.550 --> 34:00.110
Miss Dongfang has already left.

34:00.110 --> 34:01.030
What about Hongye?

34:01.030 --> 34:02.350
I told Hongye that my grandfather wanted

34:02.350 --> 34:04.570
to have a heart-to-heart talk with him,

34:04.640 --> 34:06.550
so he immediately ran away.

34:06.590 --> 34:08.110
He was going to Ruyi Pavilion
to see Fifth Sister.

34:08.110 --> 34:09.360
As expected of you, Yitan.

34:09.360 --> 34:10.630
Your timing is perfect.

34:10.630 --> 34:11.159
Let's go.

34:27.449 --> 34:28.310
How's it going?

34:29.199 --> 34:31.199
Miss Dongfang has already arrived.

34:31.780 --> 34:32.639
What about you?

34:32.679 --> 34:34.550
Have you arranged the person we need?

34:34.550 --> 34:35.730
It's all been arranged.

34:35.730 --> 34:39.270
Look, that Taoist priest will stop Miss Dongfang

34:39.350 --> 34:40.679
and ask her to draw a fortune stick.

34:40.679 --> 34:41.880
Miss, please wait.

34:41.100 --> 34:46.520
[Nanhu Inn]

34:43.030 --> 34:45.110
I see a peach blossom flush on your face,

34:45.110 --> 34:46.909
as if your love star is in motion.

34:47.860 --> 34:50.630
I have iron fortune sticks here
that can determine love fates,

34:50.630 --> 34:52.630
but they only work for those
destined to be together.

34:52.630 --> 34:55.230
Miss, would you like to have your fortune told?

34:55.230 --> 34:56.280
[Nanhu Inn]

34:55.690 --> 34:56.360
Miss.

34:56.380 --> 35:00.260
In this vast world, isn't there anyone
you care about?

35:11.960 --> 35:14.610
Don't worry, no matter how she shakes it,

35:14.630 --> 35:16.840
she will only draw that destined fortune stick.

35:16.840 --> 35:19.020
It will fall at Hongye's feet,

35:19.040 --> 35:20.810
and only he can pick it up.

35:20.890 --> 35:22.750
Here he comes. Here comes Hongye.

35:24.070 --> 35:25.080
Miss Huaizhu.

35:25.100 --> 35:26.430
Young Master Wangquan.

35:30.510 --> 35:32.860
Huaizhu, why didn't you take me
shopping with you?

35:32.860 --> 35:33.840
Why is she here?

35:33.840 --> 35:34.960
I swear that candied hawthorn stick

35:34.960 --> 35:36.760
could even knock you out.

35:38.720 --> 35:40.730
[Nanhu Inn]

35:39.110 --> 35:39.710
You dropped your fortune stick.

35:39.710 --> 35:41.040
Let me pick it up for you.

36:00.230 --> 36:02.320
You two are outstanding individuals,

36:02.320 --> 36:03.920
truly chosen by heaven.

36:04.660 --> 36:07.590
You are destined to be together
in three lifetimes.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.360
You haven't even read what's written
on the fortune stick.

36:09.360 --> 36:11.890
How do you know we're destined
to be together?

36:15.320 --> 36:17.510
Only bamboo conceals a golden blade.

36:17.960 --> 36:20.230
With apricot, there's no need for plum.

36:20.400 --> 36:22.280
Forming a bond brings wealth and honor.

36:22.280 --> 36:24.740
Heaven grants its convenience.

36:24.880 --> 36:25.920
Miss, look.

36:26.260 --> 36:28.800
If this isn't heaven's choice, what is?

36:29.320 --> 36:32.030
This fortune stick is indeed
the best of the best,

36:32.030 --> 36:33.230
but as for the person,

36:33.790 --> 36:35.020
I'm not worthy.

36:36.960 --> 36:37.710
Let's go.

36:44.400 --> 36:46.830
How much did Wangquan Zui pay you?

36:46.850 --> 36:49.310
I don't understand what you're saying, Sir.

36:49.320 --> 36:51.510
But your destined romance

36:51.530 --> 36:53.400
requires the help of an object.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.840
Destined romance.

37:03.960 --> 37:05.430
Aided by an object.

37:05.550 --> 37:07.150
Destined romance.

37:07.230 --> 37:09.230
Aided by an object.

37:12.620 --> 37:14.700
There are a lot of fun things up ahead.

37:14.720 --> 37:16.140
Did you bring the Wind and Rain Talisman
with you?

37:16.140 --> 37:17.230
Rest assured.

37:23.670 --> 37:24.960
It's going to rain. Let's hurry back.

37:24.960 --> 37:25.580
Okay.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.630
Destined romance.

37:33.650 --> 37:34.980
Aided by an object.

37:38.000 --> 37:39.600
What talisman did you bring?

38:19.290 --> 38:21.120
Dear nephew Hongye.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.510
This rain is really well-timed.

38:24.710 --> 38:27.510
That fortune stick also fell
in such a strange way.

38:27.590 --> 38:30.590
And that person who tried to drug me
with the candied hawthorn stick.

38:30.590 --> 38:32.510
How low.

38:32.540 --> 38:33.350
Qinlan.

38:34.580 --> 38:35.330
Let's go.

38:35.360 --> 38:36.660
We have important matters to attend to.

38:36.660 --> 38:37.220
Coming.

38:51.590 --> 38:55.050
It's alright, you don't need to
take responsibility for this.

38:56.350 --> 38:57.370
Next,

38:58.320 --> 38:59.880
are Hongye and Miss Dongfang

38:59.880 --> 39:01.210
going to Ruyi Pavilion?

39:04.400 --> 39:05.250
Ruyi Pavilion.

39:05.250 --> 39:07.060
Right. Let's go to Ruyi Pavilion right away.

39:07.060 --> 39:07.790
Okay.

39:10.410 --> 39:12.330
[Ruyi Pavilion]

39:10.650 --> 39:13.910
These are all the latest designs
of the Qingmu's this year.

39:14.180 --> 39:16.910
Please feel free to browse and select, everyone.

39:23.890 --> 39:28.870
[Qingmu Yuan, the Mask Group's Side]

39:31.960 --> 39:32.840
Miss Qingmu.

39:33.010 --> 39:35.740
The guest I'm expecting should be arriving soon.

39:36.070 --> 39:37.150
Is everything ready?

39:37.150 --> 39:38.000
Yes.

39:38.110 --> 39:39.040
All in position.

39:41.510 --> 39:43.720
Miss Qingmu, look.

39:55.320 --> 39:56.650
Young Master Wangquan?

39:59.320 --> 40:00.720
Young Master Wangquan!

40:10.150 --> 40:11.280
Where did this young gentleman come from?

40:11.280 --> 40:12.730
He's so handsome and elegant.

40:12.730 --> 40:13.800
Indeed he is.

40:13.800 --> 40:16.870
This is Wangquan Hongye, Young Master
of the Yiqi Alliance.

40:16.870 --> 40:19.670
I didn't expect Wangquan Hongye
to be so handsome.

40:20.510 --> 40:22.070
He's stolen my heart in the blink of an eye.

40:22.070 --> 40:23.400
These ladies

40:23.400 --> 40:26.430
can actually see past Young Master's
disheveled appearance

40:26.430 --> 40:28.810
and observe his unique celestial charm.

40:29.320 --> 40:30.850
That's really impressive.

40:38.560 --> 40:39.890
Young Master Wangquan.

40:40.210 --> 40:42.290
The items you ordered have all arrived.

40:42.290 --> 40:43.750
Please follow me to the second floor
to take a look.
